<title>SPAIN: Bank of Spain cuts key rate by 50 bps to 6.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Spain cuts key rate by 50 bps to 6.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain said it cut its key money rate to 6.25 percent from 6.75 percent at today's regular repurchase tender for central bank certificates.</p>
<p>It allotted 4.539 trillion pesetas against 4.539 trillion worth of bids.</p>
</text>
